SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Panteleimon\, Finikas
LOCATION:Finikas\, Syros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The parish church of Finikas on the south-west coast celebrates Agios Panteleimon on 26-27 July with vespers and a seaside panigiri: food from the association\, wine and island music by the marina. The Catholic chapel of the same saint at Papouri in Apano Meria keeps a smaller feast the same evening.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/syros/#finikas-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-finikas
